      "result": "## QA Test Completion Summary\n\n**Total Tests: 18**\n- **PASS: 14** ✓\n- **FAIL: 4** ✗\n\n### Results by Category\n\n**Functionality (FT):**\n- FT-1: ✗ FAIL - No data persistence (in-memory only)\n- FT-2: ✓ PASS - Add fields with types (Text, Number, Date, Checkbox)\n- FT-3: ✓ PASS - Enter and save all field types\n- FT-4: ✓ PASS - Switch between table/card views without data loss\n- FT-5: ✓ PASS - Sort with independent states per view\n- FT-6: ✓ PASS - Filter and search functionality\n- FT-7: ✓ PASS - Manual reordering with independent order per view\n- FT-19: ✗ FAIL - Import feature not found/implemented\n\n**Constraints (CS):**\n- CS-8: ✓ PASS - Number field validation (type=\"number\")\n- CS-9: ✓ PASS - Date field validation (type=\"date\")\n- CS-11: ✓ PASS - Sort preserves entries and values\n- CS-12: ✓ PASS - Filter restores all data when cleared\n- CS-13: ✓ PASS - Consistent display in both views\n- CS-14: ✓ PASS - Field types clearly labeled with appropriate controls\n- CS-15: ✓ PASS - Checkbox states distinguishable (Yes/No)\n- CS-20: ✗ FAIL - Search matches raw values, not formatted displays\n\n**Interactions (IX):**\n- IX-17: ✓ PASS - Case-insensitive search with dynamic result count\n- IX-18: ✓ PASS - Sort immediately reorders and shows active field/direction\n\n### Critical Issues\n\n1. **Data Persistence**: New entries are lost after page reload. Storage check shows localStorage/sessionStorage empty (in-memory only).\n2. **Missing Import**: No import UI, button, or dialog found anywhere in application.\n3. **Search Format Mismatch**: Search matches raw date formats (2026-01-15) but not displayed formats (Jan 15, 2026).",
